  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>Miss E. Facey, confectioner, is listed at No. 184 <ref target="civic?id=Queensberry%20Street">Queensberry Street</ref> in 1915 and 1920. It is on the Brompton Row corner.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>On the electoral roll</head>
        <p>Elizabeth Facey, confectioner, is on the 1919 <ref target="civic?id=Electoral-Rolls">electoral roll</ref> at 184 Queensberry Street.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Neighbours</head>
        <p>H. Gardner, greengrocer, is at No. 186 in 1915. After her, No. 184 is still a confectioner's: T. Carroll, hairdresser and confectioner, is there in 1925 and 1930.</p>
      </div>
